(LIQUIDITY, CAPITAL AND OUTLOOK) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cash and cash equivalents were $44.6 million at 30 April 2026, against $41.9 million at) Tj
T*
(the end of the first quarter. The company carries no debt. Capital expenditure in the) Tj
T*
(quarter was $1.8 million, principally the pressure-cycling chamber installed at the) Tj
T*
(Aberdeen test facility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operating cash flow was $5.2 million. Days sales outstanding were 61, unchanged from the) Tj
T*
(prior quarter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(FULL-YEAR GUIDANCE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We are reaffirming revenue guidance of $118 million to $124 million for fiscal 2026. The) Tj
T*
(guidance assumes that HX-9 firmware remediation is completed within the $2.4 million) Tj
T*
(accrued, that Trondsen Offshore takes delivery on the schedule in the current backlog, and) Tj
T*
(that PT-40 supply is uninterrupted.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The board has not authorised a dividend or a repurchase programme for fiscal 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This report contains forward-looking statements about a company that does not exist.) Tj
T*
